{"stories": [{"title": "Bilingual Semantic Equivalence Validator for CoCu Titles and Content Sections", "priority": "high", "description": "Verify that English and Bahasa Malaysia translations across all 20 CoCu files maintain semantic equivalence using sentence-transformers embeddings. Compute cosine similarity for CoCu titles, section headers, and key terms. Flag pairs scoring below 0.85 threshold.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Create scripts/validate_bilingual_equivalence.py that loads sentence-transformers model, compares English/Malay pairs from all 20 CoCu files, outputs JSON report to output/bilingual_equivalence_report.json with per-section similarity scores and flagged mismatches (similarity < 0.85)", "CLI: uv run scripts/validate_bilingual_equivalence.py --input content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md --threshold 0.85 --output output/bilingual_report.json", "Exit with code 0 if all pairs >= 0.85, code 1 if mismatches found; report includes count of equivalent pairs, list of below-threshold sections, and remediation suggestions"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner"}, {"title": "NOSS Header Format Compliance Auditor Across All 20 CoCu Files", "priority": "high", "description": "Scan all 20 CoCu files in content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/ and validate NOSS header table structure (Program Code, Level, Unit Title, Work Activities, Code, Page). Check for missing rows, malformed markdown tables, or incomplete header data. Generate compliance report per level.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Create scripts/audit_noss_headers.py that parses markdown tables from each CoCu, validates presence of 6 required columns (Program Code, Level, Unit Title, Work Activities, Code, Page), outputs JSON to output/noss_header_audit.json with per-file pass/fail status and specific column issues", "CLI: uv run scripts/audit_noss_headers.py --input content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md --output output/noss_header_audit.json", "Report includes total CoCu files scanned (20), pass count, fail count, and per-file remediation steps; exit code 0 if all pass, code 1 if any CoCu has malformed header"], "estimatedComplexity": "small", "_source": "product-owner"}, {"title": "Cognitive Load Analyzer for CoCu Content Readability and Complexity", "priority": "medium", "description": "Measure readability of all CoCu content sections using Flesch-Kincaid grade level, passive voice percentage, and sentence complexity metrics. Flag sections exceeding grade 12 threshold or >30% passive voice. Output HTML dashboard with heatmap showing cognitive load across all 20 CoCu files.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Create scripts/analyze_cognitive_load.py using textstat library to compute Flesch-Kincaid, passive voice detection via spaCy, and average sentence length per section in all 20 CoCu files; output JSON to output/cognitive_load_analysis.json with per-section scores", "CLI: uv run scripts/analyze_cognitive_load.py --input content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md --grade-threshold 12 --passive-voice-threshold 30 --output output/cognitive_load.json", "Generate output/cognitive_load_heatmap.html showing top 10 high-load sections, flagged sections >grade 12, and remediation suggestions (simplify sentences, reduce passive voice); exit code 1 if any section exceeds thresholds"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner"}, {"title": "Learning Outcome Coverage Validator Ensuring 95%+ Exercise-Assessment Pairing", "priority": "high", "description": "Analyze all 20 CoCu files to ensure each learning outcome in the Learning Outcome Matrix section has at least one corresponding practical exercise and one assessment criterion. Measure coverage percentage and generate gap report highlighting outcomes without paired activities.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Create scripts/validate_outcome_coverage.py that extracts learning outcome matrices and cross-references with Practical Exercise Worksheets and Assessment Criteria sections per CoCu; output JSON to output/outcome_coverage_report.json showing coverage % per file and list of unpaired outcomes", "CLI: uv run scripts/validate_outcome_coverage.py --input content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md --min-coverage 0.95 --output output/outcome_coverage.json", "Report includes total outcomes across all 20 files, paired count, unpaired count, per-CoCu coverage %, and list of outcomes needing new exercises; exit code 1 if any CoCu <95% coverage"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner"}, {"title": "Malaysian Workplace Integration Scenario Generator for L5 CoCu Capstone", "priority": "medium", "description": "Generate 3-5 contextual workplace scenarios for each L5 CoCu (7 files total) that tie theoretical content to real IT job roles in Malaysia. Reference SIRIM standards, BNM guidelines, and ISCO-08 occupational classifications. Scenarios include job title, workplace context, and competency application example.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Create scripts/generate_workplace_scenarios.py that generates workplace scenario content for all L5 CoCu, references SIRIM/BNM/ISCO-08 standards in scenario text, outputs JSON to output/l5_workplace_scenarios.json with one object per CoCu containing 4-5 scenarios per file", "CLI: uv run scripts/generate_workplace_scenarios.py --level 5 --output output/l5_workplace_scenarios.json", "Each scenario includes: job_title (IT Operator/Administrator/Technician per ISCO-08), workplace_context (50-100 words), competency_application (200-300 words tying to CoCu learning outcomes), and standards_references (SIRIM/BNM/ISCO-08 cites)"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner"}, {"title": "4-Level Performance Rubric Generator Aligned to Bloom's 2023 Taxonomy", "priority": "high", "description": "Generate Bloom's 2023-aligned performance rubrics (Novice/Intermediate/Proficient/Expert levels) for each CoCu assessment section across all 20 files. Create as Excel workbooks with scoring guidance, anchor descriptors, and point allocations. Rubrics integrate with Assessment Criteria section.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Create scripts/generate_performance_rubrics.py that extracts assessment criteria from each CoCu, generates 4-level Bloom's 2023 rubrics (Remember/Understand/Apply/Analyze/Evaluate/Create mapped to Novice/Intermediate/Proficient/Expert), outputs Excel to output/L{3,4,5}_performance_rubrics.xlsx with per-CoCu worksheets", "CLI: uv run scripts/generate_performance_rubrics.py --input content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md --output output/", "Each Excel file includes sheets for all CoCu files in that level, each sheet has columns: Competency, Novice (0-60%), Intermediate (61-75%), Proficient (76-90%), Expert (91-100%) with behavioral descriptors; total 20 sheets across 3 files"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner"}, {"title": "Competency Prerequisite Dependency Grapher with Circular Dependency Detection", "priority": "medium", "description": "Build a directed acyclic graph (DAG) showing which CoCu competencies logically depend on other competencies across all 20 files and all 3 levels. Detect and flag circular dependencies. Generate SVG visualization of learning sequencing and JSON DAG structure for curriculum design.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Create scripts/graph_competency_dependencies.py that analyzes CoCu learning outcome matrices, infers prerequisite relationships from content progression and explicit dependency markers, builds DAG, detects cycles, outputs JSON DAG to output/competency_graph.json and SVG to output/competency_dependencies.svg", "CLI: uv run scripts/graph_competency_dependencies.py --input content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md --output output/", "DAG JSON includes nodes (competency IDs), edges (prerequisite relationships), and cycle_check results; SVG shows color-coded levels (L3/L4/L5) with edge directions; exit code 1 if cycles detected"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner"}, {"title": "Content Duplication Detector Using Semantic Similarity Threshold", "priority": "low", "description": "Scan all 20 CoCu files for near-duplicate or redundant content sections using sentence-transformers semantic similarity. Flag content pairs exceeding 0.85 cosine similarity threshold that appear in different CoCu files or same level. Generate CSV report with similar sections for consolidation or intentional variation review.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Create scripts/detect_content_duplication.py that chunks all CoCu sections, computes embeddings via sentence-transformers, identifies pairs with cosine similarity >= 0.85, outputs CSV to output/duplication_report.csv with columns: source_cocu1, section1, source_cocu2, section2, similarity_score, suggested_action", "CLI: uv run scripts/detect_content_duplication.py --input content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md --threshold 0.85 --output output/duplication_report.csv", "Report includes count of duplicate pairs found, grouped by level, and recommendations (consolidate/variation/reference); exit code 0 if duplicates found (informational), exit code 1 if critical duplicates (>3 pairs same section)"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner"}, {"title": "Instructor Facilitation Guide Generator with 50-Minute Session Plans", "priority": "medium", "description": "Create detailed instructor facilitation guides for each of the 20 CoCu files, breaking down activities into 5-minute time blocks. Include materials list, learning check-in questions, common misconceptions, and transition notes. Output as structured PDF per CoCu with consistent formatting.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Create scripts/generate_facilitation_guides.py that extracts CoCu structure, generates 50-minute session plans (Introduction 5m, Activity 1 15m, Check-in 5m, Activity 2 20m, Wrap-up 5m), outputs JSON to output/facilitation_guides.json with one guide object per CoCu containing timing blocks, materials, check-in questions, misconceptions", "CLI: uv run scripts/generate_facilitation_guides.py --input content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md --output output/facilitation_guides.json", "Each guide includes: session_title, learning_objectives, materials_list, 5-min blocks (time_block, activity_name, instructor_notes, student_materials), learning_check_ins (3-4 questions per session), common_misconceptions (2-3 per session), transition_notes; total 20 guides across JSON file"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner"}, {"title": "JPK Submission Readiness Scorer with 25+ Compliance Checks and Remediation Hints", "priority": "high", "description": "Run comprehensive JPK compliance validation across all 20 CoCu files checking: NOSS header format, contact hours mathematics, 30/70 Knowledge/Performance split, assessment criteria presence, bilingual title equivalence, section coverage (learning outcomes, practical exercises, assessment, references). Generate JSON report with per-CoCu pass/fail status and actionable remediation steps.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Create scripts/score_jkp_readiness.py that executes 25+ validation checks (header_format_valid, contact_hours_correct_l3_1200, contact_hours_formula_valid_l4_l5, knowledge_performance_30_70_split, assessment_criteria_present, bilingual_titles_exist, learning_outcome_matrix_present, practical_exercises_count>=3, references_section_exists, tools_equipment_listed, key_terms_defined, etc.), outputs JSON to output/jkp_readiness_report.json with per-CoCu checklist and summary score", "CLI: uv run scripts/score_jkp_readiness.py --input content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md --output output/jkp_readiness_report.json", "Report includes: check_name, status (PASS/FAIL/WARN), remediation_hint, per_cocu_results (pass_count, fail_count, readiness_percentage), overall_readiness_score (0-100%), list of critical failures blocking submission; exit code 0 if all pass, code 2 if critical failures"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner"}]}
